WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.328
Zoom! Roxy shot down West Street.

2
00:00:09.329 --> 00:00:11.997
"What's Rocket Girl doing?" cried a man.

3
00:00:11.998 --> 00:00:14.222
"Is she chasing someone?"

4
00:00:14.223 --> 00:00:17.426
"I don't see anyone," said another person.

5
00:00:17.427 --> 00:00:20.458
Roxy fired her eye laser beams.

6
00:00:20.459 --> 00:00:23.547
Ka-boom! A mailbox blew up.

7
00:00:23.548 --> 00:00:27.199
Letters went everywhere. Whiz-hoo!

8
00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:29.831
She fired her eye laser beams again.

9
00:00:29.832 --> 00:00:32.973
This time a garbage can blew up.

10
00:00:32.974 --> 00:00:38.090
"Rocket Girl is destroying Metro City!" cried a woman.

11
00:00:38.091 --> 00:00:41.930
"She looks really angry," said a kid.

12
00:00:41.931 --> 00:00:45.313
Roxy landed and looked around.

13
00:00:45.314 --> 00:00:46.951
She stamped her foot.

14
00:00:46.952 --> 00:00:54.740
"Aargh!" Roxy cried.

15
00:00:54.741 --> 00:00:58.718
"This is the best episode ever!" said Jack.

16
00:00:58.719 --> 00:01:02.651
Roxy and her friends were watching Mighty Man at Jack's house.

17
00:01:02.652 --> 00:01:07.394
"I hope Mighty Man can stop the monster lizard!" said Mara.

18
00:01:07.395 --> 00:01:12.297
Roxy laughed. "Mighty Man always stops the monster.

19
00:01:12.298 --> 00:01:14.369
He's a superhero!"

20
00:01:14.370 --> 00:01:19.055
Just then a news reporter appeared on the TV screen.

21
00:01:19.056 --> 00:01:22.599
"We have some important news," said the reporter.

22
00:01:22.600 --> 00:01:27.843
"Earlier today witnesses saw Rocket Girl trying to destroy Metro City."

23
00:01:27.844 --> 00:01:30.105
"What!" cried Terrell.

24
00:01:30.106 --> 00:01:32.995
"Rocket Girl would never do that!"

25
00:01:32.996 --> 00:01:35.182
The reporter was still talking.

26
00:01:35.183 --> 00:01:38.022
"One witness recorded this video.

27
00:01:38.023 --> 00:01:41.592
It shows Rocket Girl blowing things up.

28
00:01:41.593 --> 00:01:44.503
As you can see, she looks pretty angry.

29
00:01:44.504 --> 00:01:46.792
Nobody knows why she did this.

30
00:01:46.793 --> 00:01:50.065
But MBS News will be following the story!

31
00:01:50.066 --> 00:01:54.072
We now return to Mighty Man ."

32
00:01:54.073 --> 00:01:56.682
Mighty Man came back on.

33
00:01:56.683 --> 00:02:00.302
But Roxy and her friends didn't pay much attention.

34
00:02:00.303 --> 00:02:05.447
"There's no way Rocket Girl would destroy Metro City," said Terrell.

35
00:02:05.448 --> 00:02:07.587
"I don't believe it!"

36
00:02:07.588 --> 00:02:11.652
Jack shrugged. "It was on the news."

37
00:02:11.653 --> 00:02:14.046
Terrell thought for a second.

38
00:02:14.047 --> 00:02:17.662
"Maybe she was chasing a bad guy," he said.

39
00:02:17.663 --> 00:02:20.218
Mara shook her head.

40
00:02:20.219 --> 00:02:22.577
"Nobody else was in the video."

41
00:02:22.578 --> 00:02:24.680
Terrell rubbed his chin.

42
00:02:24.681 --> 00:02:29.367
"Well, maybe the bad guy was really fast and got away."

43
00:02:29.368 --> 00:02:35.521
"A villain faster than Rocket Girl?" asked Mara. "No way!"

44
00:02:35.522 --> 00:02:37.597
Terrell looked at Roxy.

45
00:02:37.598 --> 00:02:39.747
She seemed upset.

46
00:02:39.748 --> 00:02:43.465
"Are you okay, Roxy?" asked Terrell.

47
00:02:43.466 --> 00:02:49.338
Roxy jumped. "Me? Yeah, I'm fine. Why?"

48
00:02:49.339 --> 00:02:52.189
Terrell looked at her suspiciously.

49
00:02:52.190 --> 00:02:55.220
"What do you think Rocket Girl was doing?

50
00:02:55.221 --> 00:02:58.647
You don't think she's a bad guy now, do you?"

51
00:02:58.648 --> 00:03:03.128
Just then Roxy's watch beeped.

52
00:03:03.129 --> 00:03:05.849
"I'll be right back," said Roxy.

53
00:03:05.850 --> 00:03:10.732
"I need some water."

54
00:03:10.733 --> 00:03:18.269
Roxy went into Jack's kitchen and pressed the button on her watch.

55
00:03:18.270 --> 00:03:20.954
"Rocket Girl," said Mayor Bloom.

56
00:03:20.955 --> 00:03:23.770
"We're close to catching the Ghost Bandit.

57
00:03:23.771 --> 00:03:27.001
He just tried to rob the Metro City Mint.

58
00:03:27.002 --> 00:03:31.563
Police have the building surrounded, but they can't find him anywhere."

59
00:03:31.564 --> 00:03:33.896
"Don't worry, Mayor," said Roxy.

60
00:03:33.897 --> 00:03:39.117
"I'm on my way!"

